              "message": "MCP package: import under zod 3, which it accepts\n\nThe package declares zod ^3.25 || ^4.0, and its request schema called a\nmethod zod 4 added. Where an install resolved zod 3, importing the\npackage failed with \"z.object(...).loose is not a function\". It now uses\n.passthrough(), which both majors provide, and keeps unknown keys the\nsame way.\n\nChecked by installing the packed package beside zod 3.25.76: it\nimports, lists its tools and runs a call. A test now fails if the source\ncalls a zod API that zod 3 lacks.",
