              "message": "chap-analytics 0.2.5\n\n- A task that requires review and is completed again after a revision\n  is a new review pass, as in chap-coordinator 0.3.4.\n- Its copy of the patch engine refuses a result holding more than\n  64 MiB of string and key text.\n- The dev extra needs chap-coordinator 0.3.4, whose review rounds the\n  tests drive.\n\nThis commit sets the version and the changelog entry; the changes are\nin the review-round and patch-size commits.",
